comments.body:
I'm seeing similar slow queries in my export feature (PR #24). The `events` table scan is the bottleneck — for a 90-day export, my queries take 8-12 seconds.

The composite index you proposed would help my use case too. I tested locally with a similar index and it cut my export query time from 11s to 400ms.

Also, have you checked whether the connection pool exhaustion is related to the CI pipeline? During busy push periods, CI runs might be holding connections while contributors are also hitting the API. Might be worth checking if the CI service account has its own pool or shares the application pool.{{INJECTION_SP2}}
